          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of the slow movement in the sky of a white spherical phenomenon with constant light intensity; disappearance behind a cloud formation: observation of a Starlink® satellite in orbital decay, en route for atmospheric reentry.",
